# Customer-facing brand naming

On anything a customer sees or hears — spoken scripts, YouTube titles/descriptions/tags, video stills, thumbnails, site copy, social posts — use **Rashad West** or **Sports Tech West** only.

Never use internal codenames on those surfaces: RaSun, SunRa, STW, Rawson, or similar.

Internal-only (code, folder names, presets like `rasun`, ElevenLabs voice labels, `.env` keys) may keep those names.

Series product titles such as bikeIQ / hikingIQ stay as public series names.
